# Outbound destinations the first-minute default deny keeps open
# (design 01, section 6.1), beyond the scored services in `services`.
# Format: `address proto port`, one per line; address is an address or CIDR,
# proto is tcp or udp, port is a number or `any`. Include DNS resolvers,
# NTP servers, the SIEM, the package mirror or proxy, and anything a scored
# service connects out to. Placeholder (documentation) ranges only.

